Description: MCP server for Microsoft 365 mail, calendar and to-do tasks
 A Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that lets LLMs interact with
 Microsoft 365 through the Graph API: mail (Outlook), calendar and
 Microsoft To Do tasks, plus optional presets for files, contacts,
 Excel and Teams.
 .
 Authentication uses MSAL (device-code or app credential flow). This
 package vendors its production npm dependencies under
 /usr/share/ms-365-mcp-server, since the bulk of the upstream Node.js
 dependency tree (Azure SDK, MCP SDK, and friends — some 240 packages)
 is not available in the Debian archive.
